# The dirk-ui-studio package. Locally this is a symlink to your working copy so
# edits to the package show up here immediately; in CI the release workflow
# checks the private repo out to this same path and builds it. Either way
# web/package.json resolves it as `link:../.studio`, so the path is identical in
# both places and nothing has to be rewritten at build time.
.studio
